# Draft 3 M5
profile own
scope.begin s
new a A
dynamic.refresh initial a
scope.transfer s s a
snapshot.check initial
scope.split s a p
dynamic.refresh token a
own.move p renamed
snapshot.check token
# Logical SSA rename leaves epoch unchanged; explicit check uses current holder.
dynamic.check a s renamed 1
dynamic.refresh moved a
snapshot.check moved
own.admit renamed s
use a
dynamic.refresh admitted a
snapshot.check admitted
scope.end s
